OL,3,GNEWSAThousands watch elaborate carnival
OL,4,Acart procession
OL,5,
OL,6,FRock shows, Del Boy and his
OL,7,Fthree-wheeler from Only Fools and
OL,8,FHorses, and a circus big top were among
OL,9,Fthe themes showcased during a
OL,10,Fspectacular illuminated carnival
OL,11,Fprocession.
OL,13,FThousands of people watched the event
OL,14,Fin Bridgwater, Somerset, where clubs
OL,15,Fspend the entire year preparing carts
OL,16,Ffor the show.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
