OL,3,GNEWSAThousands watch elaborate carnival
OL,4,Acart procession
OL,5,
OL,6,FDan Prosser from the Renegades Carnival
OL,7,FClub said the preparations were "more
OL,8,Flike a lifestyle than just a hobby,"
OL,9,Fadding his non-carnival friends think
OL,10,Fhis devotion to the event is
OL,11,F"absolutely nuts".
OL,13,FThe carnival ended with 210 people -
OL,14,Fincluding local MP Sir Ashley Fox -
OL,15,Ftaking part in squibbing, where a large
OL,16,Ffirework, strapped to a solid block of
OL,17,Fwood on the end of a pole, is lit.
